Package: STwrapper
Title: Convert Camera-Trap Staying Time Records to 'ctrest' Detection Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("kfukasawa37", email = "fukasawa@nies.go.jp", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts per-video staying time annotations of animals in front of
    camera traps into the detection data format used by the 'ctrest' package
    (REST / RAD-REST models). Staying events that span several consecutive
    videos are merged into one event using the Enter_new / Enter_cont flags,
    and right censoring is taken from the last video of each event.
